// @ens-test --jobs 2
// @exit 0
// @stdout PASS the first test hands a value to the second
// @stdout PASS the second test answers the first
// @stdout PASS a third test runs beside them
// @stdout 3/3 tests passed
// With two jobs the first two tests run at the same time, so each can wait for the other, and the results
// still come out in the order the tests are written, whichever finished first.
